WEBVTT - typo3-content-blocks (narration, English)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:07.904
A new element once meant TCA, SQL, TypoScript and a template.

2
00:00:12.604 --> 00:00:16.979
You ask for a teaser: headline, image, link.

3
00:00:19.104 --> 00:00:25.908
make:content-block creates the block; the skill writes fields, template and preview.

4
00:00:29.274 --> 00:00:34.407
The teaser shows up in the wizard. An editor fills it in and saves.

5
00:00:36.874 --> 00:00:40.883
A renamed field leaves records that look empty.

6
00:00:42.483 --> 00:00:45.552
Open source. Clone the skills.
